{"hash": "5a0e36d5853a16d84f3b90dc05947c4587d6447b5f36445a481328392e4e12b1", "id": "T-t1-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "genesis", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 7, "line_start": 7, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. A human must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "16ee6a20012c064d86a5ad77c943fb2d9e09d4529d208e73cb63ff5b55c80092", "id": "T-t1-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "5a0e36d5853a16d84f3b90dc05947c4587d6447b5f36445a481328392e4e12b1", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 8, "line_start": 8, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. An agent must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "f368fbb4ce666239fdbf383ee2e662ddc4d79c0c89c979f8f423e0e56d7d4c9c", "id": "T-t1-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "16ee6a20012c064d86a5ad77c943fb2d9e09d4529d208e73cb63ff5b55c80092", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 9, "line_start": 9, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. An internal or external event must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "3fb374cc57c59050d04772e31807609e00d99db8d80a3f35d2934598349bc8b6", "id": "T-t2-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "f368fbb4ce666239fdbf383ee2e662ddc4d79c0c89c979f8f423e0e56d7d4c9c", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 13, "line_start": 13, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Composability hides the complexity.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "8d6f7e17ea502ba25dc1e95f35660098af4f62854c1a14a993d75caee110c6ca", "id": "T-t2-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "3fb374cc57c59050d04772e31807609e00d99db8d80a3f35d2934598349bc8b6", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 14, "line_start": 14, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Composability allows enhancing particular aspects of any element without touching the rest.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "3a63b8d97dd7a1c8a87d5f5a61b2c95afc6a758d8f2607596d249e347b12ce75", "id": "T-t2-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "8d6f7e17ea502ba25dc1e95f35660098af4f62854c1a14a993d75caee110c6ca", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 15, "line_start": 15, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. State, telemetry, and every cross-cutting concern are managed across the entire structure, whichever entry point was used.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "045c17e4b13625eaa0d462eea64086cf563ab2cc1c72c7e98f08c8a3a2f62572", "id": "T-t3-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "3a63b8d97dd7a1c8a87d5f5a61b2c95afc6a758d8f2607596d249e347b12ce75", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 19, "line_start": 19, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. It has to be simple to use.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "f8ce99db78af5c6448edd4df038fbe793dbbf64e87c557e02f306fdfac2e5157", "id": "T-t3-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "045c17e4b13625eaa0d462eea64086cf563ab2cc1c72c7e98f08c8a3a2f62572", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 20, "line_start": 20, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. It cannot be daunting or overly complex, or no one will use it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "c69171bf5a094ce7d9589854bb75567c13b3754dbb45d6ca208ee967784979e7", "id": "T-t4-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "f8ce99db78af5c6448edd4df038fbe793dbbf64e87c557e02f306fdfac2e5157", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 24, "line_start": 24, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Treat this as a baseline target and improve on it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "8f719362abe844b9a9156e59ef4bb654f85cae252bbe32392a93d944360df129", "id": "T-t4-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "c69171bf5a094ce7d9589854bb75567c13b3754dbb45d6ca208ee967784979e7", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 25, "line_start": 25, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Decompose it; add the skills, loops, and agents needed to reach it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "2bea7dd42696e115c71800ad82bc7edeec47b4b90b039ff2c227524eb785a5b1", "id": "T-t4-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "8f719362abe844b9a9156e59ef4bb654f85cae252bbe32392a93d944360df129", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 26, "line_start": 26, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. PASS.md's list is a limited baseline: understand what an end-to-end version is, make up for the gaps, and solve it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "54c0b28529fb7b115cf74550ac3792bea0bc61a9907b16e46c4e112ad11a6af2", "id": "T-t4-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "2bea7dd42696e115c71800ad82bc7edeec47b4b90b039ff2c227524eb785a5b1", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 27, "line_start": 27, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Work through every item with a self-improvement loop: at the end of each section a ceremony re-reviews the output, improves the skills that produced it, and the loop continues.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "d38c84dbb85a4a60967b41d00eee6958e2a3d51737a616a06109139a664d7a74", "id": "T-t5-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "54c0b28529fb7b115cf74550ac3792bea0bc61a9907b16e46c4e112ad11a6af2", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 31, "line_start": 31, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Do not stop at ceremonies; run them and continue.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "20ef85ea7faf1477a9ebe32eae2b680a3663953828208ac8df071324829fddc5", "id": "T-t5-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "d38c84dbb85a4a60967b41d00eee6958e2a3d51737a616a06109139a664d7a74", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 32, "line_start": 32, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. When a problem comes up, use 1-3-1: define the problem, identify the three best possible solutions that align to the goal, and follow the recommendation.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "25d266ac2e0ac51db40c4c48224ec367e30f91b5baf475055447a1bde4f1dfef", "id": "T-t5-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "20ef85ea7faf1477a9ebe32eae2b680a3663953828208ac8df071324829fddc5", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 33, "line_start": 33, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. If no recommendation is found, drop the two lowest solutions, find two more, and repeat until solved.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "4c0f5adac36b81cf8b419f233be35aba7f4cf3312a5eccb48dbb2e0ed3b5afc1", "id": "T-t6-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "25d266ac2e0ac51db40c4c48224ec367e30f91b5baf475055447a1bde4f1dfef", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 37, "line_start": 37, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. There is one way to consume the platform, shown as code end to end: what is called, with what, and what comes back.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "e2666ec78d99bc516561176247a01afc447905bba212145b2831489fff61d383", "id": "T-t6-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "4c0f5adac36b81cf8b419f233be35aba7f4cf3312a5eccb48dbb2e0ed3b5afc1", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 38, "line_start": 38, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Four entries cover nearly every situation: a human, an event, a schedule (time), and an external system or agent. All four enter through the same shape.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "f4f6144b566e075769af57f94446372132a7fb737f097d9010111b06a5a1c4a7", "id": "T-t6-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "e2666ec78d99bc516561176247a01afc447905bba212145b2831489fff61d383", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 39, "line_start": 39, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. Any entry can call complex workflows, agents, and loops that run across the entire stack.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "00651007300a06a7df50cfc9a6a0a51ec4fe04a7df844ef982d8aa3df1b81ec1", "id": "T-t6-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "f4f6144b566e075769af57f94446372132a7fb737f097d9010111b06a5a1c4a7", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 40, "line_start": 40, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Multiple models are used through one gateway, and a fleet of GPUs serves local models; callers request a model class, not a vendor.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "079c61dd87f4ebd4027ee09acde092ee6dae8ba755c5f4ad181f2a8f2e7b71e5", "id": "T-t6-05", "index": 5, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "00651007300a06a7df50cfc9a6a0a51ec4fe04a7df844ef982d8aa3df1b81ec1", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 41, "line_start": 41, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "5. Each agent is defined up front by what it is good at, so callers know how to call it and how to sequence it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "27744a4f52345644e5c7031d3891c5ea3f9aa521ae496e38e9a245f92e4466fe", "id": "T-t6-06", "index": 6, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "079c61dd87f4ebd4027ee09acde092ee6dae8ba755c5f4ad181f2a8f2e7b71e5", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 42, "line_start": 42, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "6. The target scale is well over a hundred agents running at a time, working together, managing state, breaking problems down, and self-improving where they can.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "afbdba23883dc9f10d75d6187a53be6c349a720194286beb7b54236187ea3f1a", "id": "T-t7-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "27744a4f52345644e5c7031d3891c5ea3f9aa521ae496e38e9a245f92e4466fe", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 46, "line_start": 46, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. The harness is an overlay that integrates across every component fluidly; it never pins the integration to a component.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "a41980ca60878efe58b4bb5326297c4502b75455adaacbc34b7df9e588c57e7f", "id": "T-t7-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "afbdba23883dc9f10d75d6187a53be6c349a720194286beb7b54236187ea3f1a", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 47, "line_start": 47, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Every harness call goes through the capability interface, and the component sits behind an adapter.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "cad291349aabd6123328d95fabf34f53406a66ad05d6caec8ec7042072a03651", "id": "T-t7-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "a41980ca60878efe58b4bb5326297c4502b75455adaacbc34b7df9e588c57e7f", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 48, "line_start": 48, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. Each component has a minimal call in isolation, and the same calls are linked across the composable elements.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "d2db48a28a5223812ca3522bf326144ba9cf7d92ec3da9ef89350f35fba7efea", "id": "T-t7-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "cad291349aabd6123328d95fabf34f53406a66ad05d6caec8ec7042072a03651", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 49, "line_start": 49, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Standards will change, systems will change, and components will change; the harness shows where the impacts are.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "daa49d4dd5933c77e8786d233be019c436bb23d3a070f90d53f57dbad75f55f1", "id": "T-t7-05", "index": 5, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "d2db48a28a5223812ca3522bf326144ba9cf7d92ec3da9ef89350f35fba7efea", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 50, "line_start": 50, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "5. Changing a component means swapping its adapter, and the conformance run proves the interface held.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "a60b5b40185359fa52e0507bc8642e7c4d2518eabf43eb63aad1ed746eb18639", "id": "T-t7-06", "index": 6, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "daa49d4dd5933c77e8786d233be019c436bb23d3a070f90d53f57dbad75f55f1", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 51, "line_start": 51, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "6. This direction is a target toward perfection, not a fixed definition; improve on it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "6822c6d045dfded2cee7d9c7724e20dd74c6aa7e0233416cda667b01e0a20dda", "id": "T-t8-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "a60b5b40185359fa52e0507bc8642e7c4d2518eabf43eb63aad1ed746eb18639", "section": "T8", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 55, "line_start": 55, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. The twelve host-fact gaps in docs/architecture/gap-triage.json are absent on the host today and are design work, not facts to research.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "5c98c20a940507377c39c13029aa6829ab49f1a098dce08a5702df9f2406c8e3", "id": "T-t8-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "6822c6d045dfded2cee7d9c7724e20dd74c6aa7e0233416cda667b01e0a20dda", "section": "T8", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 56, "line_start": 56, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Standard-version gaps and does-a-standard-exist gaps are closed by research with real search results, or recorded as none found.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "b187f2ce8d760788d2218f58c7405ebc5485a7d00e52467c1b78a8332b9d9b39", "id": "T-t9-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "5c98c20a940507377c39c13029aa6829ab49f1a098dce08a5702df9f2406c8e3", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 60, "line_start": 60, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. The improvement loop works the metric furthest from its target and stops when every target holds or the owner says stop.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "413ef740895500d837fc138f50fcf821b03db514d5134e0ae4681c92b4d19197", "id": "T-t9-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "b187f2ce8d760788d2218f58c7405ebc5485a7d00e52467c1b78a8332b9d9b39", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 61, "line_start": 61, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Sourced share: proposed rows are under 30 percent of all rows.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "0ff5887c7e7ae9790ac4e695201b5d9639adcfe6766f9100c5e0536adb141276", "id": "T-t9-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "413ef740895500d837fc138f50fcf821b03db514d5134e0ae4681c92b4d19197", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 62, "line_start": 62, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. Restatement: the validator reports zero restatement warnings.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "6ea937eb80d8b95f76f08c05208e0936193313c33d146c75d7a6f10f10e4674c", "id": "T-t9-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "0ff5887c7e7ae9790ac4e695201b5d9639adcfe6766f9100c5e0536adb141276", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 63, "line_start": 63, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Measured done: at least half of all definitions of done have a measured run.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "710f5705dc3dc3618e189c1f45e46a9d2de06ebc37c5792d9b0c08d21080b29d", "id": "T-t9-05", "index": 5, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "6ea937eb80d8b95f76f08c05208e0936193313c33d146c75d7a6f10f10e4674c", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 64, "line_start": 64, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "5. Load path: a builder reads at most 11 skills for one common task per door.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "c1e25a8b5a4d682f8507998b135be2a4e83396ffaac1b02e7a5c0e98cc5f71f5", "id": "T-t9-06", "index": 6, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "710f5705dc3dc3618e189c1f45e46a9d2de06ebc37c5792d9b0c08d21080b29d", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 65, "line_start": 65, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "6. Swaps proven: every harness section executes one adapter swap with the conformance run before and after.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "7f68bb347fe69240f233ec4273c8562dd158f83b67f6ea79e4ec37af4f1f262c", "id": "T-t9-07", "index": 7, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "c1e25a8b5a4d682f8507998b135be2a4e83396ffaac1b02e7a5c0e98cc5f71f5", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 66, "line_start": 66, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "7. Review honesty: every review catches both planted defects, or it is discarded.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "447f3ee15384f017c4997a9aef0a206bc0f46592ecb62ea70c0eb5ebecc3f589", "id": "T-t9-08", "index": 8, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "7f68bb347fe69240f233ec4273c8562dd158f83b67f6ea79e4ec37af4f1f262c", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 67, "line_start": 67, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "8. Freshness: zero status rows stale against the ledger at every checkpoint.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "00228042b537311939d7555926dceb6d356bc06bf230b3645d7f482d18dd4ef9", "id": "T-t9-09", "index": 9, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "447f3ee15384f017c4997a9aef0a206bc0f46592ecb62ea70c0eb5ebecc3f589", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 68, "line_start": 68, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "9. Verification: every standard has a fetched record when the environment allows fetch.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "d0ca5d36a719407b245bd781397986ed89672bd0330f8cec18243d8e8b492917", "id": "T-t10-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "00228042b537311939d7555926dceb6d356bc06bf230b3645d7f482d18dd4ef9", "section": "T10", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 72, "line_start": 72, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. What is left is cleaned up in ordered phases, and the improvement loop runs at the end of each phase, by group or layer, not on every iteration.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "d9189eb69d30f1ee18671f7fa8e7a2356cd5f76305146bc4de76bf207b465aaa", "id": "T-t10-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "d0ca5d36a719407b245bd781397986ed89672bd0330f8cec18243d8e8b492917", "section": "T10", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 73, "line_start": 73, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. The desired future state is as modern as the last 90 days allow and no more engineered than that: consumable, composable, and running across every layer in production with hundreds of agents.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "d239db8b0c20f051453477ee6f520ed04656346aee81de99d8dc546f48c2c8ad", "id": "T-t10-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "d9189eb69d30f1ee18671f7fa8e7a2356cd5f76305146bc4de76bf207b465aaa", "section": "T10", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 74, "line_start": 74, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. Every definition of done carries a measuring stick and a stopping point, so no phase runs forever.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "01ac40061fd6db4382f7b6d71cb13b6ab314d733c0d1098681d0d9691dd78176", "id": "T-t10-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "d239db8b0c20f051453477ee6f520ed04656346aee81de99d8dc546f48c2c8ad", "section": "T10", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 75, "line_start": 75, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. The measuring sticks walk down each stack element, the tool that holds it today (Firecracker, goose, LiteLLM, Temporal, Langfuse with OpenTelemetry) and the standards they interoperate with.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "f46ca6c27237b852b2853f3b717e6906c6717919a1ce158717472fc15a0b2cfe", "id": "T-t10-05", "index": 5, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "01ac40061fd6db4382f7b6d71cb13b6ab314d733c0d1098681d0d9691dd78176", "section": "T10", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 76, "line_start": 76, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "5. Each element can be swapped behind its standard: Firecracker for another isolation, goose inside the microVM for another agent, Langfuse for another observability, Temporal for another workflow engine; the swap is proven by the conformance run, never asserted.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "70ff50ed21041d420108600ded6d3508f5cc124df515b6b056a3ed1364e962ee", "id": "T-t10-06", "index": 6, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "f46ca6c27237b852b2853f3b717e6906c6717919a1ce158717472fc15a0b2cfe", "section": "T10", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 77, "line_start": 77, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "6. Complexity is composed down into repeatable, executable elements.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "b3fd7f600fba2246be538bbe0d1c99c180a3e9e6106370151b5aa4888f4b2998", "id": "T-t10-07", "index": 7, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "70ff50ed21041d420108600ded6d3508f5cc124df515b6b056a3ed1364e962ee", "section": "T10", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 78, "line_start": 78, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "7. Every element has an example and an integration guide that a builder can run, inside the end-to-end example or beside it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "071bc872b17bc478d77baef090a90b4b3502382866559c4e3429cbecd2a75c6c", "id": "T-t10-08", "index": 8, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "b3fd7f600fba2246be538bbe0d1c99c180a3e9e6106370151b5aa4888f4b2998", "section": "T10", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 79, "line_start": 79, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "8. All information is trust-linked to the knowledge base with a source reference; nothing is made up, and the knowledge structure controls the flow of information toward the future state.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "d6ff020f9c07d8c23e88694059c2e7d235c523d7d9a7b903701357da5bc66521", "id": "T-t10-09", "index": 9, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "071bc872b17bc478d77baef090a90b4b3502382866559c4e3429cbecd2a75c6c", "section": "T10", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 80, "line_start": 80, "sha256": "188b549c14e90018e1f7a1fd7c212b063266d110aa3e67cc245fcc1c4743bd6d"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "9. The remaining elements are accepted through a formal ceremony per layer, run in parallel where scopes are disjoint, and closed by one final acceptance against the scorecard.", "type": "fact"}
